comments.body:
@julianoes I want set the yaw angle of the drone itself. How?
If I fix get_mavlink_param4() function as: **yaw_angle_deg = _gimbal_yaw_deg**, Drone will fly with YAW set in _new_item->set_gimbal_pitch_and_yaw(float pitch_deg, float yaw_deg)_ function.
I understand when set MIS_YAWMODE in QGroundControl is: **Heading as set by waypoint** , and Drone will fly with YAW set in missionitem. So, Do we haven't **set_pitch_and_yaw** function?

